      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "UMM YOU CAN’T PARK THERE! On May 20, a Brown Field AS350 crew assisted Chula Vista Border Patrol Agents with a vehicle that failed to yield. The vehicle ended up losing control and came to a stop in the median of the freeway.  The driver and passenger both bailed out of the vehicle and attempted to flee the area. The AS350 crew maintained visual of the subjects and were able to direct ground agents to their location for apprehension. 2 in federal custody thanks to great teamwork! #BorderSecurity",
