      "text": "🛟 RESCUE - On May 15, a San Diego Marine Unit received a radio call from a U.S. Border Patrol unit about a distressed swimmer in the San Diego Bay. Marine Interdiction Agents diverted from their patrol to the reported location and successfully recovered the person in the water. Agents provided a blanket, personal flotation device and offered medical attention. The subject was transported to Glorietta Bay. #SavingLives",
